        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.poster.avif?t=1776966170\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.webm?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.mp4?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex Blast</strong> is a <strong>horde survival x roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where you strategize on a hex grid, chaining explosive card combos to wipe out cyber hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.poster.avif?t=1776966170\" width=542 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.webm?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.mp4?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boot up your robot—each with unique abilities and a customizable deck—to firewall your core systems against relentless viral hordes!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/6fb01217d780153aabc839266a9810c3.avif?t=1776966170\" width=600 height=253 /></span>Discover devastating synergies: Shatter the battlefield with earthquake builds, transform defense into offense with shield fortresses, or engineer entirely new combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, acquire powerful chips, and refine the ultimate engine to outsmart ever-adapting cyber threats—before they overwhelm you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Robots</strong> - each with their own unique cards and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ cards and relics</strong> - infinite synergies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Hex Grid</strong> - position cards for explosive chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving cyber threats</strong> - adapt as enemies mutate into deadlier forms and swarm in relentless waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability</strong> - no two runs play the same</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.poster.avif?t=1776966170\" width=542 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.webm?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/f1c7be4beff767bfd46db3bef9bf2039.mp4?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hex Blast</strong> is a <strong>horde survival x roguelike deckbuilder</strong> where you strategize on a hex grid, chaining explosive card combos to wipe out cyber hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.poster.avif?t=1776966170\" width=542 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.webm?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/de84a760106534b2af20252429ad5b44.mp4?t=1776966170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Boot up your robot—each with unique abilities and a customizable deck—to firewall your core systems against relentless viral hordes!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3463290/extras/6fb01217d780153aabc839266a9810c3.avif?t=1776966170\" width=600 height=253 /></span>Discover devastating synergies: Shatter the battlefield with earthquake builds, transform defense into offense with shield fortresses, or engineer entirely new combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck, acquire powerful chips, and refine the ultimate engine to outsmart ever-adapting cyber threats—before they overwhelm you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Playable Robots</strong> - each with their own unique cards and relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+ cards and relics</strong> - infinite synergies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Hex Grid</strong> - position cards for explosive chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving cyber threats</strong> - adapt as enemies mutate into deadlier forms and swarm in relentless waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability</strong> - no two runs play the same</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Hex Blast is a horde survival x roguelike deckbuilder where you strategize on a hex grid, chaining explosive card combos to wipe out cyber hordes. Build your deck, collect overclocked chips, and discover the most broken builds to annihilate cyber threats—before they overwhelm you.",
